  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for rice millers to integrate food fortification through the Ghana School Feeding Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention is to support ongoing policy reform work and part of wider group of projects to build viability of fortification industry in Ghana and bring about policy reform which supports rice processers. The scope of activity builds on existing work by other donors, this will create economies of scale, it will also leverage significant prior investment in feasibility and identification of relevant private sector actors.</narrative>
  </description>
